flowchart TD
  A[Monthly NASA observation<br/>anomaly in °C] --> B[Clamp to -1.0…+1.5 °C]
  B --> C[Normalize within 2.5 °C domain]
  C --> D[Linear frequency mapping]
  D --> E[220…660 Hz]
  E --> F[Short sine oscillator note]
  F --> G[Gain envelope prevents clicks]
  G --> H[Current date, anomaly,<br/>frequency and chart marker]

  N[1951–1980 baseline] -. defines anomaly .-> A
